      "b-00-meta.title": "Seedhi Rekha mein Motion",
      "b-00-meta.objectives.0": "Is paath ke baad aap position, velocity aur acceleration ka use karke seedhi rekha ke saath motion describe kar sakte hain.",
      "b-00-meta.objectives.1": "Is paath ke baad aap position-time aur velocity-time graphs se velocity aur acceleration padh sakte hain.",
      "b-00-meta.objectives.2": "Is paath ke baad aap uniformly accelerated motion aur free fall ke liye kinematic equations ka use kar sakte hain.",
      "b-00-meta.objectives.3": "Is paath ke baad aap average speed ko average velocity ke magnitude se distinguish kar sakte hain aur frame of reference ke saath relative motion explain kar sakte hain.",
      "b-00-meta.glossary.0.term": "Position",
      "b-00-meta.glossary.0.definition": "Kisi object ki location chosen origin ke respect mein; seedhi rekha ke motion mein right positive aur left negative hota hai.",
